Motion must be smooth, purposeful, reversible when scroll-bound, and consistent with natural browsing.

Do not add animation merely because an element exists.

Use a centralized motion-token system.

Suggested motion definitions:

```ts
const motionTokens = {
  duration: {
    micro: 0.18,
    short: 0.32,
    medium: 0.55,
    long: 0.78
  },
  distance: {
    subtle: 12,
    standard: 20,
    editorial: 28
  },
  stagger: {
    fast: 0.06,
    normal: 0.12
  },
  easing: [0.22, 1, 0.36, 1]
};
